{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_dino_brawl_cleanup_cleanup_chantier", "label": "Dino Brawl cleanup workstream", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Structural refactor preparing the app for gameplay scalability; explicitly excludes prefab/factory, data-driven Tiled spawns, and combat systems."}, {"id": "docs_dino_brawl_cleanup_script_vs_spawn_principle", "label": "A script is per-frame behaviour; composition lives in the spawn function", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The single guiding principle everything else derives from: PlayerScript.onCreate doing setScale/sortingOrder and WallScript.onCreate calling addComponent were static setup disguised as behaviour."}, {"id": "docs_dino_brawl_cleanup_config_module", "label": "game/config.ts (SortingLayer, CollisionLayers, SortingOrder, MAP_SCALE)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Centralizes magic strings/numbers scattered across 4 files (shadow -1, shadow 8, player 10, wall 10, sword 20) so sort order is readable at a glance and collision layers are ready for the collisions workstream."}, {"id": "docs_dino_brawl_cleanup_controls_module", "label": "game/controls.ts (dinoControls + DinoControls)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "defineActions and the Inputs type were duplicated across the scene and two scripts; the dead `hello` action (Key.MouseLeft, never read) is deleted."}, {"id": "docs_dino_brawl_cleanup_spawn_functions", "label": "game/spawn/* local spawn functions", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Plain TS functions with no registry, no engine API and no generic abstraction \u2014 deliberately local because absorbing them is the job of the future prefab workstream; they also make multi-player parameterisable."}, {"id": "docs_dino_brawl_cleanup_arenascene", "label": "ArenaScene (ex EcsScene)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Renamed because EcsScene named the technology, not the role; reduced to defining sorting layers, loading the map, calling spawn* in order and activating the camera."}, {"id": "docs_dino_brawl_cleanup_tiled_folder_cleanup", "label": "game/tiled/ in-place cleanup", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Real defects fixed rather than extracted to a package: unassigned TileSet.tileWidth/tileHeight (type must tell the truth), the two compensating -1 offsets on firstGid/getId, missing return type on getSerializedLayer, the tileidth typo, and dead LayerManager.addLayer / TileLayer."}, {"id": "docs_dino_brawl_cleanup_dead_code_removal", "label": "Dead code removal", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "WallScript, TileLayer, Window.tsx, the hello action, SwordScript.sprite, LayerManager.addLayer; also renames blueDinoSprite/blueDinoTexture which actually load the YELLOW dino."}, {"id": "docs_dino_brawl_cleanup_app_shell_split", "label": "app/ shell split (App / GameCanvas / DebugOverlay)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "App.tsx mixed three concerns \u2014 React mounting, engine bootstrap (8 plugins, renderer, physics world, lifecycle) and the FPS debug overlay."}, {"id": "docs_dino_brawl_cleanup_zero_behavior_change", "label": "Zero behaviour change constraint", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The game must stay strictly identical on screen, so verification is a visual before/after diff rather than a test suite; this is a structural refactor, not a gameplay evolution."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_dino_brawl_cleanup_cleanup_chantier", "target": "docs_dino_brawl_cleanup_script_vs_spawn_principle", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_dino_brawl_cleanup_script_vs_spawn_principle", "target": "docs_dino_brawl_cleanup_spawn_functions", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_dino_brawl_cleanup_script_vs_spawn_principle", "target": "docs_dino_brawl_cleanup_dead_code_removal", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_dino_brawl_cleanup_cleanup_chantier", "target": "docs_dino_brawl_cleanup_config_module", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_dino_brawl_cleanup_cleanup_chantie